DISPOSITION

The engineering is good and every defect this opus was failed for in rounds 2
and 3 is properly fixed. I re-drove `red --cwd` myself across four cases and
two worktrees and it is correct, including the two edges it did not have to
get right. verify is clean, check is at zero blocking with the opus still in
the rule's line of sight, 09-11 are honest assertion-level reds.

It does not close, because the nine files round 4 failed it for are the same
nine files, unmodified, and were not re-run. The finding is a reviewer's call
